    "detailed_description": "You become a ghost and use various methods to scare away the ghost investigators who come to your house.<br />\r\nSurprise, attack, curse. You can do it any way you like.<br />\r\nYou can scare them any way you like, and later replay the replay from the investigator's point of view to see what kind of ghost you were.<br />\r\nYou can keep chasing back investigators to raise your level,<br />\r\nOr you can explore how to make a scary replay video,<br />\r\nYou can play in any way you like.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbThe game starts in the first-person perspective.<br />\r\n\u30fbSome threats are made using a microphone.<br />\r\n\u30fbKeyboard and mouse controls<br />\r\n\u30fbKeyboard and mouse are used to control the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Notes<br />\r\n\u30fbThe investigator's name and voice are set at random.<br />\r\n\u30fbThe replay function saves data using the multiplayer function, so in rare cases, due to lag or other reasons, the replay results may be different from the results of the play.<br />\r\n\u3000Please understand that this may occur depending on the environment.<br />\r\n\u30fbThis game has flashing lights.<br />\r\n\u3000If you are sensitive to light, stop the game and consult a doctor if you feel any physical problems.",
